    "summary": "IndexQueue now holds an index lane and a summary lane (doc-summarise-repo and doc-summarise-entity), each with its own FIFO, drain loop and in-flight job; start runs both loops at the same time (awaited in turn, not Promise.all) and resolves when both stop. A single-document job goes ahead of a queued sweep; takeDocSummaryEdit, laneStatus and isStopping are added; depth, isProcessing and depthForRepo span both lanes; codeIndexWorkFor reads the index lane only. The existing code-index-work test asserts index-lane order only. Ten mutations each fail the tests.",
